E AX3142 1505-field-effect-field-copy.ax:22:16-17 field-effect-exceeded "the field `Loud.emit` performs IO, and the field `Quiet.emit` declares `effect(alloc)`" #"performs IO" !"a call through `Quiet.emit` is charged what the field declares and nothing else, so everything stored in it has to keep that" ?"store a function that keeps the declaration, or declare the effect on the field with `;@axiom:effect(io)`"
E AX3143 1505-field-effect-field-copy.ax:34:16-17 field-effect-unknown "the compiler can't show that the value stored in `Quiet.emit` keeps `effect(alloc)`: it is the field `Raw.send`, which declares no effects and may hold a value the compiler can't follow" #"effects unknown here" !"a call through `Quiet.emit` is charged what the field declares and nothing else, so a value whose effects can't be determined is refused rather than trusted" ?"store a named function or a lambda whose body the compiler can see, or build the record where the function is known"
